/tmp/whest-official-deps/whestbench/templates/dataset_card.md.j2:29:**This is the private Holdout split for WhestBench 2026** — consumed by the evaluator at grading time. It is not intended for participant download; the public release at [`{{ companion }}`](https://huggingface.co/datasets/{{ companion }}) is what you'll develop against.
